@startuml rust-language-support-component
title Rust Language Support v1 — Component Overview

package "ide-core" {
  [Project] as Project
  [Buffer / Tab] as Buffer
}

package "ide-lsp" {
  [LspClient] as LspClient
  [JSON-RPC event loop\n(tokio, background thread)] as EventLoop
}

package "ide-ui" {
  [IdeApp] as IdeApp
  [LspBridge] as LspBridge
  [CargoPanel] as CargoPanel
  [Problems panel] as Problems
  [Editor squiggle layouter] as Squiggles
}

node "rust-analyzer\n(subprocess, stdio)" as RA
node "cargo\n(subprocess, stdout/stderr)" as Cargo

IdeApp --> Project : project.root()\nCargo.toml detection
IdeApp --> LspBridge : owns
IdeApp --> CargoPanel : owns
LspBridge --> LspClient : start()/send()/try_recv()
LspClient --> EventLoop : drives
EventLoop --> RA : spawn + LSP over stdio
LspBridge --> Problems : diagnostics map
LspBridge --> Buffer : per-tab diagnostics
Buffer --> Squiggles : tab.scratch + tab.diagnostics
CargoPanel --> Cargo : spawn (explicit argv)\nstream stdout/stderr

note right of LspClient
  Paths validated against
  project_root before send;
  publishDiagnostics paths
  validated before emitting
  LspEvent::Diagnostics.
end note

note right of Cargo
  One command in flight at a
  time; current_dir = project
  root; no shell interpretation.
end note

@enduml
